        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\nBrightSpan P2 animated product section. Paste this WHOLE file into a Custom liquid SECTION below Product information (not into the product description).\nUpload brightspan-p2-exploded.png to the product media. The image is found by filename or alt text containing 'exploded'.\nThis section only renders on product handle pulse-led-poster-p2. Change the handle below if needed.\n{% endcomment %}\n{% if product.handle == 'pulse-led-poster-p2' %}\n{% liquid\n  assign bs_front = product.featured_image\n  assign bs_inside = blank\n  for bs_image in product.images\n    assign bs_name = bs_image.src | downcase\n    assign bs_alt = bs_image.alt | downcase\n    if bs_name contains 'exploded' or bs_alt contains 'exploded'\n      assign bs_inside = bs_image\n      break\n    endif\n  endfor\n%}\n\n<style>\n.bs-p2{--bs-ink:#142334;--bs-muted:#596777;--bs-line:#dce5ea;--bs-blue:#007eaa;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 28px;color:var(--bs-ink);font:400 16px/1.6 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left}\n.bs-p2 *{box-sizing:border-box}.bs-p2 h2,.bs-p2 h3,.bs-p2 p,.bs-p2 figure{margin:0;padding:0;letter-spacing:normal}.bs-p2 h2,.bs-p2 h3{color:inherit;font-family:inherit;text-transform:none}.bs-p2 h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.08;font-weight:750}.bs-p2 h3{font-size:23px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:700}.bs-p2 p{color:var(--bs-muted)}.bs-p2 button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:normal;text-transform:none;min-height:44px;box-shadow:none;border-radius:999px}.bs-p2 button:focus-visible,.bs-p2 summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #008eb7;outline-offset:4px}.bs-p2 button:disabled{cursor:default;opacity:.6}.bs-p2 .bs-eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--bs-blue);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px}.bs-p2 .bs-intro{margin:16px 0 0;max-width:580px;font-size:17px}.bs-p2 .bs-pillrow{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-to